{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/clearCache()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/currentSnapshot()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfo()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/restorePurchases()"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","generated":true}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Wraps a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" so a transient failure to read entitlements never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presents a previously-seen paid user as free."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResilientPaywallService"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" populates "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallState","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — and therefore the feature gate,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"account display, and whether the paywall sheet is shown — entirely from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"snapshots its wrapped service emits. A slow, silent, or throwing entitlement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read at cold launch leaves that state at its "},{"code":"free","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" default. This decorator"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps a persisted last-known-good so the gate never collapses to free on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transient failure, while the server remains the authoritative gate: a later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"live snapshot always overwrites the cache, so a genuine lapse is honoured."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cache is bounded by "},{"code":"maxCacheAge","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (72 hours by default): a stale cache"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stops vouching for "},{"code":"isPro","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — subscriptions lapse, and an install that stays"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offline past the bound must not keep pro forever — but keeps","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"hasPermanentLicense","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", because lifetime purchases don’t expire."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider-agnostic by construction — it speaks only "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", so it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wraps any base (simulated, RevenueCat, StoreKit, …). Feed the wrapped instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"both"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and any app-side reader that builds a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"monetization\/context payload from entitlements."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Back the cache with "},{"code":"KeychainKeyValueStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than "},{"code":"UserDefaults","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache vouches for a paid entitlement offline, and "},{"code":"UserDefaults","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a plist"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a user can edit or restore from a doctored backup, whereas the Keychain is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encrypted and not plist-editable. (On unsigned macOS dev builds the Keychain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can return "},{"code":"errSecMissingEntitlement","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ −34018 — see "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sandboxing &"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entitlements (macOS)"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/KeychainKeyValueStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":".)"}]},{"code":["let resilient = ResilientPaywallService(","    base: paywallService,","    store: KeychainKeyValueStore(service: \"com.example.myapp\")",")","\/\/ PaywallPlugin(..., service: resilient)   \/\/ gate + account display","\/\/ await resilient.currentSnapshot()        \/\/ server payload, off-main"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Threat-model","level":2,"text":"Threat model"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Backed by "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/KeychainKeyValueStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", the cache defends against casual plist"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editing and a doctored-backup restore: the persisted last-known-good is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encrypted and not a user-editable file. It does "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" defend against a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"jailbroken device — nothing client-side does; entitlements can always be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forged on a device the attacker fully controls. The live provider stays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authoritative whenever the app is online: any live snapshot overwrites the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache, so a genuine lapse or downgrade is honoured on the next successful"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read. "},{"code":"hasPermanentLicense","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" deliberately never expires — a lifetime purchase"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must keep working offline indefinitely."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cache holds one entitlement, not one per account. An app with sign-in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must call "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/clearCache()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" on sign-out and account switch; otherwise the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next user inherits the previous user’s entitlement whenever the live read"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fails."}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResilientPaywallService"}],"title":"ResilientPaywallService","externalID":"s:13SwiduxPaywall09ResilientB7ServiceV","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPaywall"}],"role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallState":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallState","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallState"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Current paywall state — entitlement status, sheet presentation, and async progress."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallstate","title":"PaywallState","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallState"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallService":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Provider-agnostic paywall service protocol.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallservice","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"PaywallService"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/clearCache()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/clearCache()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Forgets the persisted last-known-good entitlement."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/clearcache()","title":"clearCache()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"clearCache"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService":{"abstract":[{"text":"Wraps a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" so a transient failure to read entitlements never"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presents a previously-seen paid user as free.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResilientPaywallService"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResilientPaywallService"}],"role":"symbol","title":"ResilientPaywallService"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall","title":"SwiduxPaywall","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallPlugin":{"abstract":[{"text":"A Swidux plugin that manages paywall state and entitlement checking.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallplugin","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PaywallPlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PaywallPlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"PaywallPlugin"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s8SendableP"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/customerInfo()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfo()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fetches the current entitlement status, retrying up to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxAttempts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with exponential backoff. On success persists and returns; if every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attempt fails, returns the cached last-known-good when present and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"usable, otherwise rethrows (so the plugin’s honest ","type":"text"},{"code":".refreshFailed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path is preserved for a genuinely-unknown user). Cancellation stops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retrying immediately and falls through to the cache."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/customerinfo()","title":"customerInfo()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"customerInfo"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntitlementSnapshot"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s16SendableMetatypeP"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/customerInfoStream()":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"customerInfoStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntitlementSnapshot","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/customerinfostream()","title":"customerInfoStream()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Long-lived stream of entitlement updates. Yields the persisted"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"last-known-good first (when "},{"code":"seedsFromCache","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is on and the cache is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still usable), then forwards and persists every snapshot the base"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"stream emits. The seed has source ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".cacheSeed"},{"text":", so it can bootstrap the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plugin’s gate without superseding a pending or completed live read."}]},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/currentSnapshot()":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"currentSnapshot"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","text":"EntitlementSnapshot"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/currentsnapshot()","type":"topic","title":"currentSnapshot()","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/currentSnapshot()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Non-throwing read for callers that always want a snapshot, degrading to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"free only for a genuinely-unknown user. Convenient for building a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"per-request monetization context off the main actor."}]},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"base","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall0B7ServiceP","text":"PaywallService","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"store","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux13KeyValueStoreP","text":"KeyValueStore","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxAttempts","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"seedsFromCache","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxCacheAge","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"retryBaseDelay","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"now","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DateV","text":"Date","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/init(base:store:maxattempts:seedsfromcache:maxcacheage:retrybasedelay:now:)","type":"topic","title":"init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)","abstract":[{"text":"Creates a resilient decorator around ","type":"text"},{"code":"base","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", persisting last-known-good","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through ","type":"text"},{"code":"store","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/restorePurchases()":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/restorePurchases()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Restores previously completed purchases, forwarding to the base service."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Persists on success; rethrows on failure (a restore is an explicit user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"action, so the plugin keeps the prior state)."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/restorepurchases()","title":"restorePurchases()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"restorePurchases"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntitlementSnapshot"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/KeychainKeyValueStore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/KeychainKeyValueStore","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeychainKeyValueStore"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"code":"KeyValueStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" backed by the system Keychain."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/keychainkeyvaluestore","title":"KeychainKeyValueStore","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeychainKeyValueStore"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"}}}